     "h": "Why we started",
     "p": "We began in 2024 with a simple irritation. Most pet products fell into two camps: clinical white plastic that looked like medical equipment, or bright cartoonish toys that felt aimed at children. Neither belonged in a home where the kettle, the lamp and the coffee cup were chosen with care. We believed a cat or a dog deserved the same thought. So we started building objects we would want on our own counters."
